nt><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=575435&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">\"2026-2학기 수강신청 변경 및 정정 신청기간 안내\"</span></a>&nbsp;참조</b></span></span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">☞<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></b><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=575435&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\"></a><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=575435&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=575435&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10</span></a></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">※&nbsp; 폐강 또는 합반 과목 수강생은 변경 및 정정 신청 기간 중 여석 없는 강좌를 차수별 3과목까지 신청 가능</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>&nbsp; - (폐강과목 추가) IC0063-01, HDL설계</b></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; - (합반과목 추가) AA403-05, 환경과제연구2</b></p><div><br></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">합반강좌는 수강 변경 처리되므로, 변경된 강좌의 수업시간이 기존 수강강좌와 중복되는지 반드시 확인하시기 바라며, 시간이 중복되는 경우 수강 정정하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt;\">3. 유의사항 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">지도교수와 수강상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">추가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">가능합니다.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
